<table id='team'>
<%- team.each_slice(5) do |row| -%>
<tr>
<%- row.each do |github_user, user| -%>
<td id='<%= ERB::Util.h(user['name'].downcase.tr(' ', '-')) %>'>
<a href='https://github.com/<%= github_user %>'>
<img src='https://github.com/<%= github_user %>.png?size=200' width='140'>
</a>
<%- if user['twitter'] -%>
<h4 align='center'><a href='https://twitter.com/<%= user['twitter'] %>'><%= ERB::Util.h(user['name']) %></a></h4>
<%- else -%>
<h4 align='center'><%= ERB::Util.h(user['name']) %></h4>
<%- end -%>
</td>
<%- end -%>
</tr>
<%- end -%>
</table>
<%- unless alumni.empty? -%>

### _fastlane_ alumni

_fastlane_ wouldn't be what it is today without the countless hours these former team members have dedicated to the project ❤️

<p id='alumni'>
<%= alumni.map { |github_user, user| "<a href='https://github.com/#{github_user}'>#{ERB::Util.h(user['name'])}</a>" }.join(",\n") %>
</p>
<%- end -%>
